            "notes": "Get  [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735) as your third power. With the increased  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  from  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b), your nade becomes lethal.\n\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is a fantastic item for hybrid builds, providing insane amounts of survivability.\n\n [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) is a more offensive option if you don't need survivability. Use your nade offensively.\n\nIf you can't afford a purple this round, opt for  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), or the  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e).",
